.TH geectl-branch-detach-branch 1  "geectl-branch-detach-branch 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-branch\-detach\-branch \- Detach a branch: replace the branch link with a copy of the branched files. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl branch detach\-branch\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-package\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Detach a branch: replace the branch link with a copy of the branched files. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fI<PROJECT>\fR
The project holding the package
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
The branch package to detach
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
